    <title>药越吃越多，觉越睡越少，拿什么拯救你我的睡眠！！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2d81624233e62bc549501f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a2d81624233e62bc549501f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 16:17:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>睡不着、睡不好、不敢停药。。。如果你正在为睡眠困扰，你可能已经听过这些词：安眠药、褪黑素、gaba软糖、针灸。。。还有可能你不曾了解过的一些词：经颅磁刺激、星状神经节阻滞、压力滴定、睡眠监测、中医治疗、CBT-I。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有两种治疗失眠的方法：一种是你躺着把药吞下去，另一种是你需要爬起来，主动改变自己的行为和想法，你会怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span>别急，本期我们将把治疗失眠的所有路子都给大家一次性讲透，不偏袒、不吓唬，只说有用的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期您将听到以下内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;布丁靠搬家治好了失眠？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我们为什么睡不着？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我不玩手机，不喝咖啡，为什么还是睡不着？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;安眠药的前世今生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;新上市的新款安眠药和之前的安眠药有什么区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为什么要做睡眠监测，睡眠监测到底检测的是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;光照治疗、放松治疗、音乐治疗、正念冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;经颅磁刺激治疗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;中医治疗：中药贴敷、中药泡脚、耳穴压豆、艾灸等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;星状神经节阻滞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;重力眼罩和重力毯、白噪音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;478呼吸法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;失眠认知疗法才是最重要的，希望大家听了我们这期节目可以改变自己的睡眠认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40